sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client (SDK / Dashboard)
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant API as eval-hub API<br/>127.0.0.1:8080/TCP HTTP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>HTTPS (custom CA)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Init as eval-runtime-init
    participant Data as S3 / Git / HF<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Adapter as Adapter container
    participant Sidecar as eval-runtime-sidecar<br/>localhost:8080 HTTP
    participant Model as Model / judge endpoint
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP
    participant OTLP as OTLP Collector<br/>4317/TCP
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over Client,K8s: Flow 1 - Submit evaluation job (cluster mode)
    Client->>KRP: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>TLS, Bearer token
    KRP->>KRP: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    KRP->>API: Forward over HTTP (pod-local)<br/>X-Tenant / X-User headers
    API->>API: Check headers present, validate request
    API->>DB: INSERT evaluation (tenant column)<br/>DB password
    opt MLflow configured
        API->>MLflow: Create experiment<br/>Bearer token from file
    end
    API->>K8s: Create ConfigMap, reference Secret,<br/>NetworkPolicy, Job in tenant namespace<br/>ServiceAccount, TLS 1.2+
    API-->>KRP: 201 Created (job id)
    KRP-->>Client: Response

    Note over Init,API: Flow 2 - Evaluation Job execution (tenant namespace)
    Init->>Data: Download test data<br/>AWS keys / basic auth / HF token
    Data-->>Init: Dataset staged to shared volume
    Adapter->>Sidecar: HTTP localhost (no auth)
    Sidecar->>Model: Inference requests<br/>Model credentials injected
    Model-->>Sidecar: Completions
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: Responses
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Log results / push artifacts
    Sidecar->>MLflow: Results<br/>Bearer token (cached 5m)
    Sidecar->>OCI: Evaluation card / artifacts<br/>OCI token
    Adapter->>Sidecar: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}/events
    Sidecar->>KRP: Status event over HTTPS<br/>service-ca trust, Bearer token
    KRP->>API: X-Tenant / X-User
    API->>DB: UPDATE status / results

    Note over Client,API: Retrieve status and logs
    Client->>KRP: GET /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}/logs
    KRP->>API: X-Tenant / X-User
    API->>K8s: Read pod logs
    K8s-->>API: Logs
    API-->>Client: Logs (via proxy)

    Note over API,Prom: Flow 3 - Observability
    Prom->>API: GET /metrics on 8081/TCP<br/>HTTP, unauthenticated
    API->>OTLP: Traces / metrics / logs<br/>gRPC, TLS unless insecure
